{"title":"불꽃","artist":"DECO*27","sourceId":"reference:JKewXSw5ZkaWjz3V4sdR","sourceHash":"fb70c69e31f9a40700321ba0b73fc3c73070928e335e6aa15e378760c25ea1ea","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":34083756,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":24.48,"end":27.42,"text":"幾許かの平和と呼ばれる光","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":27.42,"end":28.82,"text":"其の影には","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":28.82,"end":31.68,"text":"常に悲惨な争いが0101(あ)った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.68,"end":34.16,"text":"葬列に参列する者は 皆","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":34.16,"end":36.64,"text":"一様に口数も少なく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":36.64,"end":39.67,"text":"雨に濡れながらも歩み続けるより","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":39.67,"end":42.01,"text":"他にはないのだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":42.01,"end":46.67,"text":"瞳(め)を閉じて暗闇(やみ)に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":46.67,"end":51.09,"text":"吐息を重ねる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":51.09,"end":56.46,"text":"そっと触れた温かな光は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":56.46,"end":60.46,"text":"小さな鼓動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":60.46,"end":64.83,"text":"否定接続詞(メ)で綴じた書物(かみ)が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":64.83,"end":69.65,"text":"歴史を操る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":69.65,"end":74.7,"text":"そっと振れた灼かな光は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":74.7,"end":78.69,"text":"誰かの『焔』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":78.69,"end":82.34,"text":"気付けば道程(みちのり)は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":82.34,"end":87.49,"text":"常に苦難と共に0101(あ)った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":87.49,"end":89.94,"text":"耐えられぬ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":89.94,"end":92.28,"text":"痛みなど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":92.28,"end":93.41,"text":"何一つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":93.41,"end":96.96000000000001,"text":"訪れないものさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":96.96000000000001,"end":101.55,"text":"歓びに咽ぶ白い朝","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":101.55,"end":105.96000000000001,"text":"哀しみに嘆く黒い夜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":105.96000000000001,"end":109.93,"text":"我等が歩んだ此の日々を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":109.93,"end":115.25,"text":"生まれる者に繋ごう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":115.25,"end":119.83,"text":"瞳に映した蒼い空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":119.83,"end":124.22,"text":"涙を溶かした碧い海","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":124.22,"end":128.25,"text":"我等が愛した此の世界(ばしょ)を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":128.25,"end":133.65,"text":"愛しい者に遺そう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":169.7,"end":174.5,"text":"嗚呼 朝と夜 は繰り返す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":174.5,"end":179.02,"text":"煌めく砂が零れても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":179.02,"end":183.53,"text":"嗚呼 朝と夜 は繰り返す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":183.53,"end":188.33,"text":"愛した花が枯れても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":188.33,"end":192.8,"text":"嗚呼 朝と夜 は繰り返す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":192.8,"end":197.39,"text":"契った指が離れても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":197.39,"end":201.78,"text":"嗚呼 朝と夜 を繰り返し","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":201.78,"end":206.65,"text":"《生命》(ひと)は廻り続ける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":206.65,"end":209.71,"text":"美しい『焔』を見た","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":209.71,"end":215.64,"text":"死を抱く暗闇の地平に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":215.64,"end":219.14,"text":"憎しみ廻る世界に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":219.14,"end":225.37,"text":"幾つかの『愛の詩』を灯そう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":225.37,"end":227.19,"text":"何れ程夜が永くとも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":227.19,"end":229.59,"text":"何れ朝は訪れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":229.59,"end":234.01,"text":"独りで寂しくないように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":234.01,"end":238.9,"text":"《双児の 人形(ラ プウペ)》を傍らに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":238.9,"end":242.56,"text":"小さな棺の揺り籠で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":242.56,"end":247.84,"text":"目覚めぬ君を送ろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":247.84,"end":250.59,"text":"歓びに揺れたのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":250.59,"end":252.39,"text":"《紫色の花》(ヴィオレット)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":252.39,"end":255.14,"text":"哀しみに濡れたのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":255.14,"end":256.81,"text":"《水色の花》(オルタンシア)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":256.81,"end":260.87,"text":"誰かが綴った此の詩を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":260.87,"end":266.39,"text":"生まれぬ君に贈ろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":266.39,"end":268.68,"text":"歴史が書を創るのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":268.68,"end":270.1,"text":"書が歴史を創るのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":270.1,"end":272.84000000000003,"text":"永遠を生きられない以上","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":272.84000000000003,"end":275.3,"text":"全てを識る由もなく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":275.3,"end":277.71,"text":"朝と夜の地平を廻る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":277.71,"end":279.8,"text":"『第五の旅路』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":279.8,"end":280.71,"text":"離れた者が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":280.71,"end":282.42,"text":"再び繋がる日は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":282.42,"end":284.61,"text":"訪れるのだろうか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":303.1,"end":304.83,"text":"懐かしき調べ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":304.83,"end":306.55,"text":"其れは誰の唇か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":306.55,"end":306.81,"text":"嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":306.81,"end":308.77,"text":"《物語》(ロマン)を詩うのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":329.52,"end":331.73,"text":"「其処にロマンは在るのかしら？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}